 Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set)\n- [Sasha Marie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set)\n- [Budgie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set)\n- [Skinny Macho's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set)\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-01-01T14:41:45+00:00"},"title":"Skinny Macho's Set","position":3}},{"id":"hygRO-3EwNQ","position":43,"timestamp":"01:09:01","rawTrack":"Mura Masa - Step 2001 (Mura’s Edit)","track":{"id":"jGHF7valHBo","path":"/artists/mura-masa/tracks/step-2001-mura-s-edit/","slug":"step-2001-muras-edit","title":"Step 2001 (Mura’s Edit)","artist":{"slug":"mura-masa","title":"Mura Masa"},"artwork":"images/artists/mura-masa/tracks/step-2001-mura-s-edit.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"ymbEftQiGo8","slug":"all-day-2020","tags":[19],"links":{},"state":"published","title":"Soulection All Day 2020","artwork":"/images/episodes/soulection-all-day-2020.jpg","content":"\n**🎊🌟 Happy New Year 2020 🌟🎊**\n\nA day of exclusive mixes from [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set), [Sasha Marie](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set), [Budgie](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set), and [Skinny Macho](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set) to bring in the new decade. \n<!--more-->\n\n#### Jump to:\n\n- [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set)\n- [Sasha Marie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set)\n- [Budgie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set)\n- [Skinny Macho's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set)\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-01-01T14:41:45+00:00"},"title":"Skinny Macho's Set","position":3}},{"id":"Ma9NrI13eLM","position":16,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mura Masa - Hustleblood","track":{"id":"wJyYwW7d_S0","path":"/artists/mura-masa/tracks/hustleblood/","slug":"hustleblood","title":"Hustleblood","artist":{"slug":"mura-masa","title":"Mura Masa"},"artwork":"images/artists/mura-masa/tracks/hustleblood.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"zg_8tfPfypk","slug":"144","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-144-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #144 w/ starRo","artwork":"/images/episodes/144.jpg","content":"\nstarRo hails all the way from Tokyo, Japan to play original productions and edits.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere have been so many guests on Soulection Radio over the past years but no one, we repeat, no one has came in the studio so humble, so low key and just murk the airwaves like starRo did. \nIt's crazy to think that this man has been making music for over 15 years and is barely coming to surface to the world with so much heat. \nWe are just glad he is on our team. He played nothing but original production/edits. \nHailing all the way from Tokyo, Japan, starRo is an artist who you will be familiar with starting from this point on. \nJoe Kay of course opened the show for the first hour & 50 minutes on one turntable (one of the turntable's went out before the show started) playing a bunch of heat that he was holding onto since last week. \nHe made sure to make up for his absence last saturday and play some exclusive Carmack, Atu, Kaytra, Esta, Esgar, Jo Def + some other heavy footwork vibes.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10812,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"GjcYHYi9xfI","position":30,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mura Masa - Shibuya","track":{"id":"VTipBYREVoU","path":"/artists/mura-masa/tracks/shibuya/","slug":"shibuya","title":"Shibuya","artist":{"slug":"mura-masa","title":"Mura Masa"},"artwork":"images/artists/mura-masa/tracks/shibuya.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"RZ